*.orig
*.rej

# Keep source, README files, dependency locks and empty .env*.example templates.
# Keep assets/stories/**/*.md, assets/3d/**/*.glb and assets/reference_page/**/*.png.
# Keep assets/display/ transparent PNGs, manifest.json and README.md, plus item icons.
# NFT artwork is a project source asset and should be included in GitHub submissions.
# Image exceptions leave secret-file exclusions intact; manifest.json is public source.
!/assets/NFT_Pic/**/*.png
!/assets/NFT_Pic/**/*.jpg
!/assets/NFT_Pic/**/*.jpeg
!/assets/NFT_Pic/**/*.webp
# Never ignore all *.json, *.sql, *.png or *.glb: these can be project sources.
